fix-command-tag-unmarshal: return TPM_RC_BAD_TAG for every invalid command tag

Classification: spec-deviation bug fix.

Every command tag other than TPM_ST_NO_SESSIONS/TPM_ST_SESSIONS is
TPM_RC_BAD_TAG (Part 2 TPMI_ST_COMMAND_TAG, Part 3 "Command Header
Validation"); upstream unmarshals a TPM_ST first, which returns TPM_RC_VALUE
for values that are not TPM_ST constants.

diff --git a/src/Unmarshal.c b/src/Unmarshal.c
